 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h8\"></path><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"3\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Practical AI</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Implement AI solutions that solve real business problems instead of chasing trends.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Workflow Automation</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Reduce manual work and connect your business systems with intelligent automation.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Microsoft 365</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Modernize collaboration with Microsoft 365, Copilot, Teams, and SharePoint.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Business Growth</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Use technology as a competitive advantage to improve efficiency and scale confidently.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><section class=\"py-32 \"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/10 px-5 py-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400\">The Novomentum Method</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-8 text-5xl font-black tracking-tight lg:text-6xl\">A proven framework for modernizing your business.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-400\">We don&#x27;t implement technology for technology&#x27;s sake. Every engagement follows a structured process designed to create measurable business momentum.</p></div><div class=\"mt-20 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] relative text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-10 w-10 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-400\">STEP <!-- -->1</div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Discover</h3><p class=\"mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-400\">We learn how your business operates, identify bottlenecks, and uncover opportunities where technology can create measurable value.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] relative text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-10 w-10 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-400\">STEP <!-- -->2</div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Modernize</h3><p class=\"mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Upgrade Microsoft 365, cloud infrastructure, collaboration tools, and security to build a strong technology foundation.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] relative text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow h-10 w-10 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-400\">STEP <!-- -->3</div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Automate</h3><p class=\"mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Eliminate repetitive work using AI, Microsoft Copilot, Power Automate, and intelligent business workflows.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] relative text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-10 w-10 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-400\">STEP <!-- -->4</div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Accelerate</h3><p class=\"mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Measure results, optimize processes, and continue improving so technology keeps delivering business value.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><section class=\"py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-20 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400\">Technology</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-5xl font-black tracking-tight\">Powered by trusted platforms.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-400\">We build modern business solutions using enterprise technologies trusted around the world.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)]\"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 